{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今年是紅軍長征勝利90周年，由長征出發地江西瑞金，至長征落腳點陝西延安的直達高鐵，今日首發。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAILWAY-1300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026hCvrRBDYwB1788677613.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAILWAY-1300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAILWAY-1300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026NNdssCe1PJ1788677628.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAILWAY-1300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">上午約11時，G3998次復興號動車組從瑞金開出，途經于都、南昌、武漢、西安等站點，晚上約10時半抵達延安。全程超過1,800公里，橫跨江西、湖北、陝西三個省，串聯沿線多個紅色地標。全程票價由約800元至2,600元人民幣不等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T07:18:45.621144+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}